1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,320
=Episode 4=

2
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,240
Miss Xia,

3
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,280
I'm sorry

4
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,280
to disappoint you.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,800
Shisi.

6
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:19,439
I've thought it over.

7
00:00:19,439 --> 00:00:21,400
Xia Honglian won't let me off.

8
00:00:21,439 --> 00:00:23,079
If dramas have taught me anything,

9
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,160
she'll try something before the trial.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,600
You mean...

11
00:00:29,879 --> 00:00:31,160
I'm not afraid to fight her.

12
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,120
I'm afraid she'll poison me again.

13
00:00:33,399 --> 00:00:34,559
What if she poisons

14
00:00:34,559 --> 00:00:36,079
my food or drinks again?

15
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,399
If I'm not careful,

16
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,560
I'll be done for.

17
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,119
You don't need to worry about that.

18
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,520
This is a Purity Pill.

19
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:48,039
It makes you immune to all poisons.

20
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,880
But its effects

21
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,240
only last three days.

22
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,799
You've had this all along

23
00:00:53,799 --> 00:00:54,479
and never told me?

24
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,159
Do you have

25
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:01,799
any other gadgets

26
00:01:01,799 --> 00:01:02,439
that can

27
00:01:02,759 --> 00:01:04,039
boost my Spiritual Power?

28
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:07,479
No.

29
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,640
I've been cultivating for ages,

30
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:13,319
but my Spiritual Power
hasn't improved at all.

31
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,000
Give me your phone.

32
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:29,920
This can be upgraded too?

33
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,680
I really do feel lighter.

34
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,680
Try attacking me now.

35
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:47,519
I'd feel bad hitting you.

36
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:48,879
Just do it.

37
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,280
Xi Yuan.

38
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,439
I can't wait to see what you can do.

39
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:00,400
Mm.

40
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:03,359
Xi Yuan.

41
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:06,159
Since you're so eager to die,

42
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,239
I'll grant your wish.

43
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,439
Impossible!

44
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,680
A lowly maid with no Spiritual Power...

45
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,319
How could you dodge my attack?

46
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:31,520
Miss Xi Yuan took on Xia Honglian

47
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,639
and didn't even get a scratch.

48
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,080
Is she really the Xi Yuan you trained?

49
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:36,800
She's only dodging.

50
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,039
She didn't fight back.

51
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,080
Honglian.

52
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:41,120
She's weaker than you.

53
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:41,960
Finish this quickly.

54
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,599
Exactly.

55
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,800
You're clearly no match for me.

56
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,719
So that's how you did it.

57
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:56,400
Breath of Flame,

58
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,800
bind at my command.

59
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:58,759
Serpent!

60
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,240
Breath of Flame,

61
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,199
heed my command.

62
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:07,599
Cage!

63
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,479
I should've been the one

64
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:17,639
to save His Highness back then.

65
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:29,319
Xi Yuan.

66
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,159
If you can't beat her,

67
00:03:31,479 --> 00:03:32,280
you can surrender.

68
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,599
I can still hold on.

69
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,120
Breath of...

70
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,000
Enough!

71
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,120
Xia Honglian.

72
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,560
You've already won.

73
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,280
That's far enough.

74
00:03:55,479 --> 00:03:57,000
Far enough?

75
00:03:58,280 --> 00:03:59,439
But Your Highness,

76
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,240
wasn't it agreed

77
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,599
that in this arena,

78
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,039
anything goes, even death?

79
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:13,280
What is that?

80
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,080
Xi Yuan.

81
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,280
Take a good look back

82
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:22,120
at your unforgettable life
in the Karmic Flame.

83
00:04:33,279 --> 00:04:34,199
No!

84
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:35,040
School?

85
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,839
Forget school!

86
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:38,879
No!

87
00:04:39,879 --> 00:04:40,439
No!

88
00:04:42,959 --> 00:04:45,240
Go on a blind date and get married.

89
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,319
Bring in a good betrothal gift

90
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:48,120
so your brother can buy
a house for marriage.

91
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,360
I'm only 19!

92
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:51,000
So what? You're 19.

93
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,959
I raised you all these years.

94
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:54,720
- No!
- Shouldn't you repay me?

95
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,600
Let go of me!

96
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,759
- No!
- I won't go!

97
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:58,160
I told you to marry him!

98
00:04:58,240 --> 00:05:00,240
How dare you run away from home?

99
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,600
You ungrateful brat!

100
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:03,480
Why don't you just die?

101
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,480
The moment you were born,

102
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,600
I should've left you outside to freeze.

103
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,079
Or thrown you into a river.

104
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,519
You were never wanted.

105
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,879
- You're useless to this family!
- I won't go!

106
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:12,639
I won't!

107
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,240
Mom.

108
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:16,120
I'm your child too.

109
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:18,600
Why have you never loved me?

110
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,480
Why?

111
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,560
Why?

112
00:05:24,399 --> 00:05:25,199
Shisi.

113
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:26,800
Calm down.

114
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:29,040
Deities can't interfere
in mortal affairs.

115
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,560
You already defied divine law
with the poisoned wine.

116
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:33,920
I warned you before

117
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:35,079
that you shouldn't watch

118
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:37,040
today's trial.

119
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:40,279
For 20 years,

120
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,959
you've always told me the same thing.

121
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:45,040
Yellow Dragon.

122
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,879
You oversee fate and divination

123
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:48,279
and can see the future.

124
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,519
But when I sent her to that world,

125
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:52,120
you never told me

126
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,000
that in this life,

127
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,680
she would suffer so much.

128
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:02,439
We tore through the bounds of time

129
00:06:02,639 --> 00:06:03,560
and fate to take her soul away.

130
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,800
We defied divine law.

131
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:07,959
In one lifetime or another,

132
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,600
calamity and suffering

133
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,079
were bound to befall her.

134
00:06:11,279 --> 00:06:12,120
There was no escape.

135
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:14,639
But Shisi,

136
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,639
no matter

137
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:19,319
how deeply you care for her,

138
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:21,240
if our plan fails,

139
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,600
we'll lose everything.

140
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:23,839
You know that.

141
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:29,879
Shisi.

142
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:33,560
If Xi Yuan wins,

143
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,480
she must win on her own.

144
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:36,839
Besides,

145
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,160
isn't he still there?

146
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,000
Shisi.

147
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:47,319
You must understand.

148
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,680
You were never

149
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,560
part of her destiny.

150
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,240
Stop!

151
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:58,240
Your Highness.

152
00:06:58,399 --> 00:07:00,079
Huyun has its traditions.

153
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:02,160
No one may interrupt

154
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,680
the Crown Princess selection trial.

155
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:05,839
Surely you wouldn't break

156
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:07,720
Huyun's rules for this woman

157
00:07:07,879 --> 00:07:10,439
and openly defy our traditions?

158
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,879
You'd kill me

159
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,800
for this woman?

160
00:07:14,399 --> 00:07:15,240
I said...

161
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:16,680
stop!

162
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:23,800
Honglian.

163
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,040
Don't do anything rash.

164
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:27,759
Your Highness.

165
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,319
If I can't

166
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:31,519
have your heart in this life,

167
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,639
then she

168
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,079
won't have it either!

169
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,759
Why is Miss Xia's Spiritual Power

170
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,560
tainted with Demonic Energy?

171
00:07:39,639 --> 00:07:42,000
The Xia family colluded
with the Demon Clan

172
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,319
to seize the Crown Princess title.

173
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:44,360
They're finally exposed!

174
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:45,000
Quick!

175
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:45,279
Get them!

176
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:47,560
Chancellor Xia.

177
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,399
We have proof

178
00:07:48,399 --> 00:07:49,279
you colluded with the Demon Clan.

179
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:50,199
What do you have to say?

180
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,160
You knew all along.

181
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:53,560
This whole thing

182
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,399
was a trap you set

183
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:57,240
to force Honglian's hand.

184
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,319
Honglian.

185
00:07:58,439 --> 00:07:59,800
All this over a man.

186
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,319
Foolish.

187
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:01,360
Utterly foolish!

188
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,720
Take them down!

189
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:04,199
Your Highness.

190
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:06,040
Xi Yuan really pulled it off.

191
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,759
No!

192
00:08:20,759 --> 00:08:22,040
Who are you?

193
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:23,800
Where did you come from?

194
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:26,439
Why do you have

195
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:29,360
so many strange memories?

196
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:32,720
Aren't I your child too?

197
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,800
Why have you never loved me?

198
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:38,480
Whatever.

199
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,840
No matter who you are,

200
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,759
you're still unloved,

201
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:46,200
and no one cares about you.

202
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,159
Xi Yuan.

203
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:58,720
♪I shut out the world, you're all I see♪

204
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:02,360
♪One glance to last forever,
just you and me♪

205
00:09:06,279 --> 00:09:07,919
(Where's the model I told you
to buy your brother?)

206
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:10,200
Crimson Lotus Karmic Flame

207
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,240
really does magnify

208
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,799
a person's pain and despair.

209
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:16,320
♪Hard to forget the losses of the past♪

210
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,279
You're part of her too.

211
00:09:21,639 --> 00:09:22,440
Go find her.

212
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,360
Why do you all hate me so much?

213
00:09:26,159 --> 00:09:28,080
Will you only be satisfied

214
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,879
when I'm dead?

215
00:09:30,759 --> 00:09:31,519
Yes.

216
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,720
Go die.

217
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:44,880
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,♪

218
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:47,960
♪the envy of everyone♪

219
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:51,760
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,♪

220
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:55,000
♪leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

221
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:58,600
♪No matter how long or hard our road,♪

222
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:01,520
♪I don't care♪

223
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:05,560
♪But you left me with this pain,♪

224
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:09,920
♪forever beyond redemption♪
